<title>USA: Sunsource LP Q3 shr $0.24 vs $0.22.</title>
<headline>Sunsource LP Q3 shr $0.24 vs $0.22.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(dollars in thousands except interest amounts)</p>
<p>   Three months			   Nine months</p>
<p>    ended Sept. 30		     ended Sept. 30</p>
<p>				     %					%</p>
